WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.600
It's from morning to night!

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.400
Oh no! Next!

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.860
1, 2, 3, 4, 5!  A, B, C, D, E, F, G!

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:10.940
1, 2, 3-way scramble!

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:13.360
Yoohoo!

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.490
Yay! Yay!

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.030
Yahoo!

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:19.740
Let's go!

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:20.330
*gobble gobble*

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:20.870
*tip tap*

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:21.660
*huff puff*

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.960
Alright! I'm all full from breakfast!

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.130
Gather everyone and let's go to school!

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.340
Monday makes me sleepy

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.420
I'll feign sick and it'll be Sunday!

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.720
Yeah! We've got field trips and sports days!

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.840
I'm so excited that I couldn't sleep!

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.010
There's a storm and typhoon warning!

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:39.390
It will be pushed back five days!

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:42.730
Tests?! No way! I don't want them!

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:48.150
I can't escape! My mind and answer sheet are both blank!

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:52.490
Let's nap in the infirmary!

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.570
Yes! Food time! Three servings of curry rice!

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.740
More! More! I want more!

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.990
My body's growing, so is my appetite!

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:01.120
1, 2, 3 and GO!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.290
I'm all ready!

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:06.170
Let's start our awesome day today!

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:09.840
I can't stop myself! I won't stop myself!

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.050
Let's all go wild!

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:16.380
Extraterritoriality? What's that?

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:20.680
I'm an elementary schooler!

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.930
It's autumn and winter!

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.100
They're great! Next!

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:29.770
1, 2, 3-way scramble!

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.780
This year is coming to an end.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.780
Another year where nothing went right for Mitsuba.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:44.790
As if you'd know what happened to me this year.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:47.540
What, you thought it all went great?

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:48.620
Are you a masochist?

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:49.960
Shut up! Die!

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.790
Drop dead right now!

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.800
Can't you guys get along at least for the New Year?

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.970
Not a chance!

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:04.060
Aren't these mandarins rotten?

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:09.440
My eyes! MY EYES!

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.310
Idioooots!

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:16.440
Mitsuba...

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:17.820
Y-You done yet?

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:23.370
Five minutes to go until the New Year...

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:28.580
I'll probably get hit with another wave, so going out now would be bad idea.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:31.380
Mitsuba, you're done already, aren't you?!

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:32.540
Not yet!

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:36.340
I'll get out just in time to start a wonderful new year!

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.220
You idiots!

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:41.390
I'm gonna borrow the toilet next door!

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:46.100
You fat p*g!

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.600
Looks like I'm fine now.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:53.270
I guess I can get out of here now.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.650
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:03.160
The toilet's just the place for someone like you to start the new year.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:07.040
It'll be worse for you than me!

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.290
I'm taking you down with me.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.790
Y-You've got to be kidding me!

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.590
Why am I stuck?!

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.800
I should be slim enough to get through.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:26.560
What are you doing there, Mitsuba?

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:28.350
Futaba!

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.230
Help me! Pull me out!

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.560
Alright!

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:34.060
One two! One two!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.980
Sorry about earlier.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.570
I love you.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.160
Retard! Trash! Just go die!

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:48.160
I-I'm joking. I love you!

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.830
I'm gonna borrow their toilet again!

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.670
Just go die already!

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:59.170
It's freezing.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.050
When did you get in?!

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.470
Umm...

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:13.560
That was the sound of your lame panties.

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:18.190
Why does this always happen to me?

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:21.690
Next year's gonna be another terrible year...

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.950
Please... Someone...

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:28.240
Please help me!

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.540
Why?

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.540
You asked for help, didn't you?

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.500
The countdown's already started.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.290
I hope next year will be a great year.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.590
O-Of course!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.230
Open up! Open the door!

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:56.230
Papa!!

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.770
You p*g!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.480
It's not my fault!

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.940
You're gonna stay a p*g this year!

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:05.990
Another wave...

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.660
Tomorrow is Valentine's Day!

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:16.080
Prove your love to that special guy with Moiji chocolates!

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.790
I wanna be with Papa...

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.270
They're still my baby girls.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.650
I'm parched.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:40.520
What's in this box?

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:46.320
Th-This is chocolate!

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.820
And it's definitely for a guy!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:51.740
Which one of my daughters...

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:54.450
...fell for which stinking guy?!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:58.420
Unforgivable!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:10.390
Death to the guy who dares to go after my little girls!

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:13.470
What brings you to our school?

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.470
Wait!

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.520
I ran into the school on the spur of the moment...

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.480
They're gonna treat me like an intruder again.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:27.990
Satou!

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.660
Where are you?

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.240
Satou!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:35.700
Valentine's Day is such a hassle.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.710
What am I gonna do with the heaps of chocolates?

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:41.250
And I've got no allies...

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:45.000
Yeah, that's a real <i>problem</i> you have there.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.510
Can you take your love comedies outside?

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:52.760
No one understands how I feel.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:55.010
I do, Satou.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:58.770
M-Mitsuba's dad?

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:02.150
I was quite the popular guy in middle school.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:04.110
Found you, Satou!

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:05.770
Crap!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.530
AH! SATOU!

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.160
As a comrade in arms, lemme help you out!

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:14.160
S-Sir!

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:18.080
That's the most dangerous pervert!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.250
Satou's innocence is in danger!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.420
Noooooo!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.290
I mean, we gotta save him!

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:27.590
But... how are we gonna do that?

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.920
Guess we have no choice.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.930
Shin was kidnapped?

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:35.760
I didn't want to ask for help from our rival in love,

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.930
but Satou's safety comes first!

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.730
Rival?

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:42.560
We'll tell the teachers and the police!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:43.690
Yes, sir!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:47.940
You're like how I was back then.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.490
Eh?

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:55.620
I was much slimmer back then, athletic, and really popular.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.370
It's scary what time does to you...

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.500
Hey now!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.300
Oh yeah, why are you here?

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.760
Shin!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:12.220
Huh?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.100
Are you alright, Shin?!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.230
Don't just jump out of the classrooms!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.060
Huh? Papa!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.940
Huh? Futaba?

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:29.020
Were you looking for Satou as well?

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:30.530
Yeah!

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:31.900
That means...

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:33.990
Futaba's gonna give that chocolate...

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:36.990
that homemade chocolate heart... to him?

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.450
So, Futaba...

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.660
Do you like Satou?

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:44.790
Yeah!

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.880
W-Wai- T-That's so sudden!

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.670
Really...

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.840
Unclench your fist, Soujirou!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.930
He's been a kind friend to Futaba since they were little kids...

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.930
He's a good boy!

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.680
I love him just the way I love you!

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:08.230
He's shy, but his kindness is just like yours!

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:10.770
I-I guess so...

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:13.570
But, I love my Papa the most!

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.160
Futaba...

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:26.580
Freeze!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.050
Satou, come here!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.590
Let me go!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:37.130
No! I'm here to check on my daughters!

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.590
Hey! Futaba!

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:44.430
What have you done to her?!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.980
Come on... Hey!

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:49.350
I know you feel comfortable in my arms, but why now?!

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:50.980
Get him!

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:54.740
It's not what you think! Release me!

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.500
Hey, mom...

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:12.250
Can you buy me new slippers?

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.210
They look fine, though.

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:16.130
They kinda smell.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.220
Slippers usually smell.

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:22.300
No, these smell like they were licked daily...

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.680
Possession marked!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:25.470
Eh?

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:27.310
N-No, it's nothing.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.440
How about my gym clothes?

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.150
I wash them by hand every day.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.900
Possession 2 marked!

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.490
Don't forget to hang my textbooks out to dry!

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:37.440
Huh?

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:43.330
Please let my mom be normal during the parent-teacher meeting!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.660
That's not gonna happen.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.580
Let's go home, Futaba.

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.460
Papa's not here yet...

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:51.960
Listen to me!

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:55.340
My son's being stalked!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:58.300
Uhh... About that...

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.470
You knew about it?!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.220
What are you saying?!

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:05.100
You're being stalked?!

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.890
If you knew, why haven't you stopped it?!

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.770
W-Well, it's between the kids.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.150
I'd rather not step in.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.860
How can you say that?!

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.860
Has any actual harm come to him?

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.360
Well...

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:22.570
He thinks someone licked his recorder.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.320
His slippers, too...

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.120
That's all?

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.410
Mrs. Sugisaki?

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:29.910
I thought they'd be like...

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:33.080
having thousands of pictures secretly taken,

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:36.550
or checking what undies he wears every day.

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:38.880
I'm not sure about those, but still...

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.760
You're well informed.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:44.550
Just thinking of such repulsive acts happening to my son is...

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.680
Miku's not that repulsive!

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:47.890
Mrs. Sugisaki!

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:49.770
Now now, Akari.

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:51.140
Senior!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:55.730
Don't kids like to tease the person they like?

00:11:57.730 --> 00:12:02.110
I caught my son developing his dirty moves using my underwear.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.280
How wonderful!

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:07.910
I hope to bring up my little Ryuu to be a healthy boy like him!

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.540
That's really unhealthy.

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.500
You've never done things like that?

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:14.210
Of course not.

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.170
Like hell you haven't!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:17.420
Papa!

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:23.050
What about crawling into my daughter's bed, and hiding under our kotatsu in your boxers?!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:26.430
N-No! They were all misunderstandings!

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:29.930
Besides, I'm not the one under police escort.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:36.480
Mr. Marui! I'd like to see Futaba and my son grow up together.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:38.570
I don't want him being stalked by someone!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.400
"Grow up together", she said!

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:42.570
What the heck is she talking about?!

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:45.700
I can trust my Futaba in his hands.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:50.120
Why are you okay with Satou but punch me without hesitating?!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:53.000
Is it 'cause I'm not as good looking?! It's my looks, isn't it?!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:56.290
He's forgetting he's not a child...

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.840
Does he even realize what he just said?

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.500
In any case...

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.010
this stalker is a big problem!

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.510
That student needs some stern discipline!

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:08.510
Mrs. Yoshioka! I knew I could count on you as the PTA president!

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:14.270
Still, love comes in many forms.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.310
Darling...

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:19.020
Just where are you touching me in the middle of a meeting?

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:21.780
Your arm.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.530
Jeez... Darling...

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:31.160
Your husband's always by your side, isn't he?

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.540
Eh?

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.040
Jeez...

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.540
This is going nowhere.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:41.040
Damn you, Futaba! You're getting too close to Satou!

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.800
Oh yeah! We've got a policeman here!

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.720
Wait! Turning this into a criminal case is a little extreme!

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:50.550
What's that?! Are you saying the school's reputation is more important?

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:53.600
Please investigate this, right away!

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:54.850
Right away?

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.730
I'm off duty today.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:59.150
Then why are you tailing me?!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:00.020
Tailing?

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:04.230
Alright! Those three will stop if a cop's involved!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:07.610
I'm just attending the parent-teacher meeting of my sister's class.

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:09.990
Big brother!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:10.660
BIG BROTHER?!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.080
BIG BROTHER?!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:17.750
Airi! Have you been waiting for me?

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:20.040
Why did you come here in uniform?

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.790
My clothes are in the laundry.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:26.800
Anyway, someone in your class is being stalked!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.130
How scary!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:31.180
Stalkers are the most unforgivable people!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.890
When I think of what would happen if they went after you...!

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:38.390
As the sister of a policeman, I'll lend you a hand!

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:39.900
That's really nice of you!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.560
So, who's the victim?

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:43.820
My son, Shin!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:46.400
Madam!

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.110
Y-Yes?

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:50.780
I'll take care of this problem!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.370
I ask that everyone leave this to me alone!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.910
How wonderful!

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.040
There's no way he can handle this.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.790
Yay!

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:05.340
It's the first time he's been so reliable!

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.050
The school ground's completely white!

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:16.430
There was a pretty heavy fall last night.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:17.930
Let's play!

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:19.680
Chiba

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:21.810
Someone wrote in the snow.

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:27.650
Peeing your name onto pure, untarnished snow...

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:29.950
...is the greatest pleasure of days like this!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.610
How disgusting.

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:32.990
I wanna try!

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:33.820
Forget it!

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.950
Boys are so childish.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:37.700
It's vulgar!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.620
It'd be fine for Satou, though... Actually, I'd love to see it.

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:41.920
Apologize to the snow!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.380
You're gross, just like your face!

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.090
Shut up you heffers!

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:50.880
You girls were watching me doing it from the shadows, right?

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.340
They were?!

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.850
What's up, squabbling in the morning?

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:59.720
Getting all worked up over the snow? You're such kids.

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:01.560
That's 'cause Chiba-

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:05.440
Why not settle it with a snowball fight?

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:07.730
It's not like I really want to have one, though.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:12.530
What's wrong?

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:15.280
I-It's nothing...

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:20.500
This looks like lemon ice...

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.170
Here goes!

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:27.420
Noooooooooo!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.630
Please stop! Forgive me!

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:37.100
My 200,000 yen coat was just-

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:49.770
Are my snowballs so terrifying, you idiots?!

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:52.240
She doesn't know the truth and now she's all fired up!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.780
MITSUBA, STOP!

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:57.990
We'll disintegrate if those touch us!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:16:59.910
Oh really?

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:05.870
You girls probably didn't know, but Satou was writing his name there before me!

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.500
What are you saying?!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:11.920
Block!

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.590
Good! Run while they become our meat shields!

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:18.090
You're the worst in every possible way!

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:20.560
Oga!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.180
I-It's not...

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.520
It's not Satou's...

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:25.560
It's not his...

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.060
My body...!

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:31.860
So they really disintegrate if it's not Satou's...

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:33.820
Was that a litmus test?!

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:38.030
You're up next!

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.540
We're gonna get hit at this rate!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:49.000
Futaba, stop her somehow!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.340
I'm almost done...

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:09.440
Mitsuba!

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.190
Victory is ours.

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.110
It's all your fault!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:15.110
Are you alright, Mitsuba?

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.820
Idiot!

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.110
That's the contaminated spot!

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:24.450
I guess they're still kids, fooling around in the snow.

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.580
It's cold. Please shut the window.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:29.620
Okay.

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:35.880
Does she have a headache?

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:38.880
It's probably 'cause you're always causing her trouble.

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:45.390
It's April Fools... What kind of trick should I pull?

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:49.520
I need to think of a good one and trick someone.

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:50.900
Huh?

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:54.360
I'm sorry for always causing you trouble.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.730
I love you!

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:58.610
Wait, why would she-

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:02.450
Gotcha! Today's April Fools!

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:05.410
That was close!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:07.200
What a horrible sister!

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.750
Want some? This just came out.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:20.380
Idiot! Today's April Fools!

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:23.640
Like I'd share it with you!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:28.020
My snacks are mine, and <i>your</i> snacks are mine!

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:34.810
What was that for?! Go die!

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:37.320
Marui

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:37.320
That was close!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:39.900
She's a terrifying p*g!

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:43.530
They're all trying to trick me!

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:45.240
I'm scared!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.080
I won't trust anyone!

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.080
Ah, Hitoha!

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:58.090
Whoa! Wait a sec!

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.590
Oh, you were here?

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:04.800
Our eyes met, didn't they? Don't just ignore me!

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.560
I can't drop my guard even if he's a teacher!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.350
He might pull a trick on me!

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:11.640
Today's a nice day.

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:12.520
You're lying.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:13.350
Eh?

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.610
It's a cloudless sky!

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:17.230
You're lying again.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:21.030
F-Fine, there's one right there.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:25.870
Wh-What happened? You don't look well.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.030
You're lying. I'm fine.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:33.040
No, you're really strange today! Are you sick?

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:37.380
You don't think I'm being strange and aren't really worried about me.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:39.130
I am!

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:44.680
Lying again... You don't give a damn about-

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.640
A-Are you okay?!

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:50.140
You're not really concerned.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:53.020
I am! See, you're bleeding!

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:55.850
Blood? That's a lie-

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.770
This is...!

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.650
Hitoha, you okay?

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.700
Hitoha? Hitoha!

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.370
She's awake!

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.040
This is...

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.620
Yabe carried you back home.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:15.830
Thank goodness. Looks like you'll be fine.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:17.380
You're lying, right?

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:20.210
That again? What's wrong?

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:25.380
On April Fools... you can't just trust someone.

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:27.300
April Fools?

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:31.140
Oh, so that's why you were so off yesterday.

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:33.310
Man!

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:36.140
The heck's with that? So that's all it was!

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:37.980
Eh? Yesterday?

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:41.860
Yeah! You were out for a whole day!

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:44.150
So today's the second of April!

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:46.530
Second... of April?

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:48.820
Yeah! Second of April!

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:52.700
So... it's no longer April Fools...

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:56.790
Which means... he did carry me back...

00:21:57.750 --> 00:21:59.710
Th-Thank you very mu-

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:02.380
Gotcha! It's April Fools!

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:05.340
It's only been an hour!

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:07.760
You fell right for it!

00:22:12.010 --> 00:22:15.310
Loser! You got tricked by a virgin!

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:16.270
Mitsuba!

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.730
PLEASE DIE, ALL OF YOU!

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:22.110
Does that mean you actually don't want us to die?

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:43.730
The three-minute rule says this candy's still safe to eat!

00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:50.700
Really, aren't you tired of making a fuss about this every time?

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:50.700
Yeah!

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:56.160
Just stop showing me that pretense of kindness

00:22:56.160 --> 00:22:59.420
Will it do good in the long term? You ask

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:01.750
It's none of your business!

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:05.210
Inspection time for all~

00:23:05.210 --> 00:23:07.720
Haven't seen that before? Does it even exist?

00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:09.050
Let's check it out!

00:23:08.630 --> 00:23:12.180
Everyone's perfectly uniform!

00:23:11.300 --> 00:23:12.180
Yeah! Yeah!

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:17.230
That's why we're straying from the path... Hurry!

00:23:14.310 --> 00:23:15.220
Go! Go!

00:23:17.230 --> 00:23:21.480
It's a good day for new encounters

00:23:21.480 --> 00:23:29.650
Next week's sparkling if you feel the weak pulse!

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:36.700
Let's have a good sleep!

00:23:36.700 --> 00:23:41.960
Once you're fully rested and recharged

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:45.880
Let's go backpacking!

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:58.420
This anime is bad for children's education!

00:23:58.420 --> 00:24:00.950
Adults shouldn't decide everything for children.

00:24:00.950 --> 00:24:02.220
Darling!

00:24:02.230 --> 00:24:04.900
What do you think you're doing in front of everyone?

00:24:05.580 --> 00:24:07.300
I'm doing the preview.

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:10.080
Sexy Thirty?

00:24:08.070 --> 00:24:09.250
Oh, darling...
